Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.44,0:09:06.69,Sign,Sign,0,0,0,,{\an1\pos(90,155)\fn@Dream Han Serif SC W27\fs90\frz270\c&H000000&\bord1\3a&HAA&\blur1\shad0}以自己过去的标准来思考的人
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.46,0:14:20.21,Sign,Sign,0,0,0,,{\an1\pos(180,210)\fn@Dream Han Serif SC W27\fs110\frz270\c&H000000&\bord1\3a&HAA&\blur1}最糟的２９岁单身男
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.61,0:18:53.61,Sign,Sign,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(960,30)\fnDream Han Serif SC W27\fs150}完全缺乏经验
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.73,0:19:00.12,Sign,Sign,0,0,0,,{\an3\pos(1600,1005)\fn@Dream Han Serif SC W27\fs110\frz270\c&H000000&\bord1\3a&HAA&\blur1}写下能让被遗弃儿童
